---
---

<!-- BEGIN: How We Work (Methodology Milestones) -->
<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#0C0D13] border-t border-white/5 relative" data-purpose="method-section" id="metodo">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6">
    <!-- Header Subtitle Bar -->
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-6 sm:pb-8 mb-10 sm:mb-12 border-b border-white/[0.08] text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-lima animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="uppercase tracking-widest text-white">quantumfactory.io</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center gap-2 uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-lima font-mono">
        <span>Metodología en producción</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-right uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-muted/70 font-mono">
        <span>Hitos 01 — 03</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Main Layout: 3 Tall Pillar Cards + Right Side Bold Title & Copy -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-10 items-stretch">
      <!-- 3-Column Pillar Cards Area -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-5">
        <!-- Pillar Card 01: Diagnóstico y viabilidad -->
        <div
          class="group relative rounded-2xl p-6 xl:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between md:min-h-[420px] xl:min-h-[500px] text-white shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 overflow-hidden border border-brand-lima/20 hover:border-brand-lima/50"
          style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181926 0%, #2b2638 55%, #181926 100%);"
        >
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-lima mb-6 md:mb-8">01</div>
            <div
              class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-brand-lima/10 border border-brand-lima/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-brand-lima shadow-sm"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.523a9.004 9.004 0 01-5.73 0l-1.57-.523m8.87 0A2.25 2.25 0 0121 17.436V18a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 013 18v-.564c0-.986.634-1.854 1.56-2.136l1.57-.523"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-neutral-400 mb-1">01 / Entender</h4>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug mb-2">Diagnóstico y viabilidad</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-6 md:pt-8 mt-6 md:mt-auto border-t border-white/10">
            <div class="text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-light font-display tracking-tight text-brand-lima mb-2">Sem 01</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 font-sans leading-relaxed">
              Mapeamos procesos y datos, calculando el retorno concreto antes de codificar.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Pillar Card 02: Prototipo en 15 días -->
        <div
          class="group relative rounded-2xl p-6 xl:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between md:min-h-[420px] xl:min-h-[500px] text-white shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 overflow-hidden border border-white/15 hover:border-brand-coral/60"
          style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #393145 0%, #7d3f5e 40%, #d84f66 75%, #ff6b7a 100%);"
        >
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-widest text-white/80 mb-6 md:mb-8">02</div>
            <div
              class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white border border-white/20 shadow-sm"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 mb-1">02 / Probar</h4>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug mb-2">Prototipo en 15 días</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-6 md:pt-8 mt-6 md:mt-auto border-t border-white/20">
            <div class="text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-light font-display tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
              15<span class="text-2xl font-sans tracking-normal ml-1 text-white/80 font-normal">días</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/90 font-sans leading-relaxed">
              Construimos y validamos el flujo principal en manos de usuarios reales sin demoras.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Pillar Card 03: Producción y entrega -->
        <div
          class="group relative rounded-2xl p-6 xl:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between md:min-h-[420px] xl:min-h-[500px] text-white shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 overflow-hidden border border-white/15 hover:border-brand-lima/60"
          style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181926 0%, #393145 25%, #a63d40 65%, #ff6b7a 100%);"
        >
          <div class="relative z-10">
            <div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-widest text-white/80 mb-6 md:mb-8">03</div>
            <div
              class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white border border-white/20 shadow-sm"
            >
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path
                  d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg
              >
            </div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-white/80 mb-1">03 / Escalar</h4>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug mb-2">Producción y entrega</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="relative z-10 pt-6 md:pt-8 mt-6 md:mt-auto border-t border-white/20">
            <div class="text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-light font-display tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
              100<span class="text-brand-lima text-3xl font-sans ml-0.5">%</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/90 font-sans leading-relaxed">
              Despliegue seguro en tu infraestructura y código 100% transferido a tu propiedad.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Right Side Content -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-between py-2 lg:pl-4 xl:pl-6">
        <div>
          <div
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-lima/10 border border-brand-lima/20 text-brand-lima text-[11px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase mb-6"
          >
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-lima"></span>
            <span>Flujo de Ingeniería</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.08] mb-6 text-balance">
            De la idea a algo que funciona <span class="italic font-serif text-brand-lima">en semanas.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Un proceso estructurado por hitos transparentes, con entregas operativas visibles y decisiones fundamentadas
            en el uso real antes de comprometer inversiones masivas.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3 sm:space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-300">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-1">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Metodología ágil:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-right">Sprints de 15 días</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-1">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Propiedad intelectual:</span>
              <span class="text-brand-lima font-semibold">100% transferida</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-1">
              <span class="text-brand-muted">Infraestructura:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-right">Nube propia / Soberana</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-8 mt-8 border-t border-white/[0.08]">
          <a
            class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-3 min-h-[48px] px-6 py-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-brand-lima text-white hover:text-brand-midnight text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold border border-white/15 hover:border-brand-lima transition-all duration-300 group"
            href="#contacto"
          >
            <span>Iniciar evaluación de viabilidad</span>
            <span class="transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 font-sans text-sm">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<!-- END: How We Work -->
